    "title": "Dutch Bros",
    "description": "Finally! Order ahead in the app. Customize your drink with flavors, toppings and more. Then pay, track points, earn rewards and order ahead. Plus, save your faves for easy ordering next time. Now when you head to Dutch Bros\u2122, your drink will be in the works and ready to go! Don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll still ask you about your day. \r\n\r\nDutch Rewards\u2122\r\nFree medium drink when you download the app and join Dutch Rewards\u2122! Each time you scan, you can earn points just for drinking your faves, which can be turned into free drinks later on. When you want to claim your rewards just scan like always. It's that simple!\r\n*Offer valid for new app users only. Free medium drink reward upon registration. Terms apply. See dutchbros.com.\r\n\r\nDutch Pass\u00ae\r\nA seamless way to pay that makes it easier than ever to enjoy Dutch. Load cash and scan whenever you want to pay or earn points. You can also show love to your Broistas by adding a tip.\r\n\r\nBirthday Rewards\r\nBe on the lookout for Birthday rewards to make your day more special!\r\n\r\nFind Shops & Browse the Menu\r\nFind and favorite the shops you go to most often. Check out the menu before you order to explore all of our awesome flavors!\r\n\r\nCollect Stickers\r\nGet hooked up with app stickers and customize your app to show your style.",
